   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Urban Health II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The specific project objectives of UPHCP II are to improve: (i) access to and use of urban PHC services in the project area, with a particular focus on extending provisions to the poorest; (ii) the quality of urban PHC services in the project area; and (iii) the cost-effectiveness, and the institutional and financial sustainability of PHC to meet the needs of the urban poor.</narrative>
